WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A QUESTION. A map. A stranger. An ordinary request.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
AN INTERRUPTION. Two workers carry a door between the speakers.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
A DIFFERENT PERSON. The first questioner leaves. Another takes his place.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
THE SAME STORY. The directions continue. The identity has changed.

5
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
SEVEN OF FIFTEEN. In the initial field condition, 7 of 15 reported noticing.

6
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
THE EVIDENCE. What was reported? What actually changed?

